00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:23.534
within Europe, and make
sure that we have at least

00:12:23.534 --> 00:12:25.200
two replicas, and you
have highest level

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:27.510
of availability for the data.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:29.310
And common use cases
for the storage class,

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:32.070
as I said before, is streaming
