00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:34.320
or just having a great
level of business continuity

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:35.904
because we take care
of all failovers.

00:12:35.904 --> 00:12:38.403
You don't need to worry about
manually failover from primary

00:12:38.403 --> 00:12:39.090
to secondary.

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:40.870
We take care of all of that.

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:43.110
And to show how
