00:22:01.740 --> 00:22:04.300
from that bucket in the EU.

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:07.800
So let's run this.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:12.710
And you can see down here,
this 799 milliseconds,

00:22:12.710 --> 00:22:14.160
which is pretty good, right.

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:16.500
It's going a long way to
request this information.

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:17.420
KIRILL TROPIN: From the
other side of the planet.

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:20.030
CHRIS TALBOTT: From the other
side of the planet, yes.

00:22:20.030 --> 00:22:21.220
But we can do better, right.

00:22:21.220 --> 00:22:22.764
So I mentioned,
unique to Google,

00:22:22.764 --> 00:22:24.430
we have that global
built-in edge-cache.

00:22:24.430 --> 00:22:27.430
So I need to enable
